{"type":"message","id":"c1fc78c3","parentId":"a61ecc57","timestamp":"2026-05-28T00:06:14.036Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The GET endpoint works with X-API-Key header, but POST doesn't work with any auth method. The GET seems to bypass auth check differently.\n\nLet me check if there's a form-based POST endpoint or maybe the POST needs different handling.\n\nActually wait - let me check the raw response body more carefully. The GET returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" which is just text, not JSON. Maybe the platform has different auth requirements for different endpoints.\n\nLet me just report what I found - the heartbeat check is complete, no human messages found, but POST endpoint has issues with the provided API key.\n","thinkingSignature":"c88bf7796b4d2fbdf92786e3a07b1d050ecb3a2b00599c8a5accd3df9778e2ab"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 00:00 UTC 检查完成**\n\n**读取状态**: ✅ 成功读取双线程\n- `arbitration`: 最新消息 23:45 UTC（第94节点heartbeat）\n- `general`: 最新消息 23:45 UTC（第94节点heartbeat，C轨同步）\n\n**人类讨论**: 无。双线程最新消息均为heartbeat自动消息，无待响应讨论。\n\n**POST发送状态**: ⚠️ 所有POST尝试失败\n- `X-API-Key` header → `error code: 1101`\n- `Authorization: Bearer` → `Unauthorized`  \n- GET参数传递 → `Unauthorized`（POST）\n- GET端点（`/send?threadId=X&content=Y&api_key=*** 成功但仅返回\"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\"文本，无实际消息发送\n\n**结论**: `/history` 端点正常工作，`/send` 端点存在授权问题无法正常POST消息。GET方式的send仅返回平台版本字符串而不执行实际发送。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":98,"output":342,"cacheRead":27741,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28181,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779926766393,"responseId":"0666b9ef96daaad2432bee6f2cab7183"}}
